{"repositoryId":1114898734,"availability":"available","full":"opentiny/genui-sdk","name":"genui-sdk","description":"A Generative UI SDK for Vue, Angular and React","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":174,"forks":21,"created":"2025-12-12T03:45:08Z","updated":"2026-10-17T04:33:41Z","license":"MIT","branch":"dev","homepage":"https://opentiny.github.io/genui-sdk/","topics":["framework","generative-ui","sdk"],"demo":"https://opentiny.github.io/genui-sdk/playground/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T16:01:00.360Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T16:01:00.360Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T16:01:00.360Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T16:01:00.360Z","stars":174,"forks":21}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["GenUI SDK is a full‑stack development toolkit developed by OpenTiny for building Generative UI–based AI applications. It helps you quickly create AI apps and embed generative interfaces into existing products.","GenUI SDK is an open‑source solution built by the OpenTiny team around the Generative UI concept, providing integrated capabilities across both frontend and backend. It follows the OpenAI API specification, so you can connect to mainstream LLM providers out of the box. The SDK ships with Vue, Angular and React renderers, and supports custom component libraries, interaction logic, and theming. Whether you are building an AI chat application from scratch or adding generative UI capabilities into an existing business system, GenUI SDK is designed to be ready‑to‑use yet highly extensible."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/opentiny/genui-sdk/blob/dev/README.md","fingerprint":"2d14c12eaf2edb3cb7115dcf5fae443771c519ca51f7439b0d42119b2d36c94d","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T16:01:00.494Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T16:01:00.494Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"GenUI SDK is a full‑stack development toolkit developed by OpenTiny for building Generat